# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says (see .editorconfig)
* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows batch files must keep CRLF: cmd.exe mis-parses labels and goto/call in LF-only files
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# The reference projects' archives: never a line ending or diff to touch
*.zap[0-9]* binary
